      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Why a black placeholder frame?\n\nInstead of a separate 'pre-warp frame 0' pipeline that duplicates\nthe cv2_remap + CVToImage nodes, this workflow creates a black\nplaceholder frame (ConstantLike -> CVToImage) as the initial accumulator.\n\nThe foreach processes ALL frames 0..N-1 identically. After the loop,\nImageFromBatch(1, N) strips the placeholder, yielding the warped batch.\n\nOne warp pipeline, no duplication. The fixed-point (CV_16SC2) maps are\nstill computed once outside the loop."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
